pexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"container main-content details-page\">\n  <div class=\"col-12 field-section1\">\n    <h2 class=\"fs-1-5 vg-0--top\">About the partner</h2>\n    <p>Indulge in a luxurious stay that matches your refined taste with Shangri-La Circle, the loyalty program offering you exceptional privileges every time you stay at Shangri-La Group hotels around the world. Experience unparalleled hospitality, exclusive rates when booking through the app or website, and premium rewards redeemable anytime, all complemented by faster check-ins via the app. With every booking, you’ll earn Shangri-La Circle Points that can be converted into AlFursan Reward Miles, unlocking unforgettable experiences filled with luxury and comfort.</p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Miles earned</h3>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Earn 500 AlFursan Miles for every eligible stay.</li>\n      <li>Convert 1 Shangri-La Circle Point to 1 AlFursan Mile (starting from 1,000 Points).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <a href=\"https://www.shangri-la.com/corporate/shangrilacircle/mobile/\" class=\"saudia-btn saudia-btn--primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Convert now</a>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">How to earn Miles</h3>\n    <p>Book your stay at Shangri-La with ease through the website, Shangri-La Circle Mobile App, or by contacting Shangri-La Worldwide Reservations, or via the toll-free number for Saudi Arabia at +800 850 1055.</p>\n    <p>To earn AlFursan Miles, simply provide your AlFursan membership number during check-in. You can also convert your Shangri-La Circle Points into AlFursan Reward Miles by following these steps:</p>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>Login to your Shangri-La Circle account.</li>\n      <li>Enter your AlFursan membership number.</li>\n      <li>Specify the number of Shangri-La Circle Points you wish to convert into AlFursan Miles.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Claim missing Miles</h3>\n    <p>For inquiries or to claim missing Miles, please contact Shangri-La Circle Customer Service at <a href=\"mailto:shangri-la.circle@shangri-la.com\">shangri-la.circle@shangri-la.com</a></p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing fs-1-3\">Terms and conditions</h3>\n    <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n      <li>AlFursan members must ensure their membership number is correctly entered at the time of booking.</li>\n      <li>AlFursan membership must be presented during check-in.</li>\n      <li>Earned Miles will be credited to the AlFursan account within 4 to 6 weeks after check-out.</li>\n      <li>Shangri-La Circle <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.shangri-la.com/en/corporate/shangrilacircle/terms-conditions/\" target=\"_blank\">terms and conditions</a> apply.</li>\n      <li>AlFursan program terms and conditions apply.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}